00:00:58.709 --> 00:01:01.712
HOW DOES IT WORK THAT ONE OF THE

00:01:00.778 --> 00:01:04.182
BIGGEST COMPANIES IN THE WORLD,

00:01:01.846 --> 00:01:04.615
AN AMERICAN COMPANY, PAYS NO

00:01:04.315 --> 00:01:07.185
